        <mxCell id="8eN1-tay9FiaeABJWpRz-19" value="Account Posting Worker" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="8eN1-tay9FiaeABJWpRz-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="420" width="120" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="8eN1-tay9FiaeABJWpRz-20" value="&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;The workflow engine will initiate account posting workflow. The account posting type will be configured as input parameter (ex: transit to nostro)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;The account posting worker will trigger the payment accounting interface to initiate the account posting. The request contains the type of account posting, payment instruction id, partition date and payment network.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Payment accounting interface will call payment history service to fetch the payment instruction details using payment instruction id, partition date and payment network.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Payment history will fetch the payment instruction details from redis. If data not present in redis, payment history will fetch the details from database.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Payment accouting interface will publishes an account posting initiation event to the Payments topic.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Consume the account posting initiation event (asynchronous flow)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;The Payment History service handles&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;(asynchronous flow):&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;Update the event log in database.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;The Payment accounting interface will create the request object for cash accouting and call the cash accouting service.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;On getting the response from cash accouting, payment accouting interface will call payment history service to do the database update.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;The Payment History service handles:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;Update the payment details in database.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Modify the payment details in cache (Redis).&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;(Note: All database and Redis operations are managed solely by Payment History)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;If the request is successfully persisted, Payment accouting interface will publishes an event to the Payments topic and sends a synchronous response back to the payment account posting&amp;nbsp; worker.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;align=left;labelPosition=center;verticalLabelPosition=middle;verticalAlign=top;" parent="8eN1-tay9FiaeABJWpRz-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-600" y="410" width="470" height="480" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="8eN1-tay9FiaeABJWpRz-21" value="Kafka (Payments)" style="shape=cylinder3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=5.965517241379246;rotation=-90;textDirection=vertical-lr;" parent="8eN1-tay9FiaeABJWpRz-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="722.09" y="569" width="40" height="201" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
